<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 10 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 10 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 10 trillion lire repurchase tender on Friday for government securities to be resold on April 1.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 6.5 trillion lire on March 17, the minimum accepted rate stood at 7.45 percent and the average rate at 7.45 percent.</p>
</text>
